data: {"id": "2e3a224b349248eb-thinking-parallel_evidence-1535", "run_id": "2e3a224b349248eb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与结论\n\n### 证据汇总\n\n| 维度 | 结果 | 事实 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **Kubernetes 状态** | ✅ present | Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 处于 **Pending / ContainerCreating**，15分钟未恢复 |\n| **Events** | ✅ present | `MountVolume.SetUp failed` — `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（x15 over 15m）；`Unable to attach or mount volumes`（x6 over 13m） |\n| **Pod YAML** | ✅ present | volume `input` 引用 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` (optional=false)；Container `app` image `python:3-alpine` |\n| **Metrics** | ✅ present", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1788416853744, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

